       {
        "role": "body",
        "text": "Multiple technology outlets covered the SEMICON Taiwan 2026 event with overlapping themes on AI‑driven semiconductor investment and supply‑chain shifts, e.g., Nvidia‑MediaTek deal boosting the Taiex [4], President Lai’s remarks on the semiconductor ecosystem [8], Nvidia and Micron’s NT$4.4 trn investment [28], TSMC’s AI integration comments [41], and broader SEMICON AI‑supply‑chain analysis [73]. These reports reflect organic news flow rather than lockstep messaging.",
